From: pbs05 <27010143+pbs05@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: select NBQ for external SerDes egress

GDM3 and GDM4 can each connect multiple net devices through an external
SerDes arbiter.  The QDMA transmit path selects the net device's NBQ, but
PPE flow entries only carry it for EN7523 GDM3.

Program the net device NBQ for direct GDM3 and GDM4 egress on every SoC.
Keep the existing GPON T-CONT and DSA port selections at higher priority.

Fixes: 7758cb462ff7 ("net: airoha: Introduce WAN device flag")
Signed-off-by: pbs05 <27010143+pbs05@users.noreply.github.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c
@@ -712,9 +712,8 @@ static int airoha_ppe_foe_entry_prepare(
 			else if (dsa_port >= 0)
 				val |= FIELD_PREP(AIROHA_FOE_IB2_NBQ,
 						  dsa_port);
-			else if (airoha_is(eth, airoha_en7523) &&
-				 port->id == AIROHA_GDM3_IDX &&
-				 dev->nbq != 0)
+			else if (port->id == AIROHA_GDM3_IDX ||
+				 port->id == AIROHA_GDM4_IDX)
 				val |= FIELD_PREP(AIROHA_FOE_IB2_NBQ, dev->nbq);
 
 			smac_id = port->id;
